  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "ebb61cea-2ebd-4121-b7c3-94b98a9acf1e",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a palavra e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "27434798-ff09-44b1-a3e9-ffbd9390b3ce",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena e escute a palavra-chave.</p><p><strong>el confinamiento</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>o confinamento</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/14a4c12d518645c792a51a4591eeb711_b01-confinamiento-home-workspace.png?Expires=1794099716&Signature=CVhTFDR051Bi3idTUFQj5XZzTu-7EVanguBF4BdcZTSeW89p73ViqLjbk22yaZ8Kb8bOfH3kOiiSOuDG7uGsEbdkpV-2ZeVDD39gEJH8p1~ikend75bnadMJqfZzbMxEt7Zrpjons7BDqJqB81WfDcoRupbNjR8NRydse4kAEjGAnC595ysF3Wn58oaHBsfHps8DDOm0AFi9tNnWzNqjQhOSkGMqQFInoYu37N34jhhzGVcIc6v6MwZTJRYsaWVC78MW35EPBbsoOrKBpz7BOCHEVCB~ztgyT53D1VzbijYyXQpKodxF~xd~fvfSDLao1huGFv4nPH3Sj3kQH3V5bg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/74f111f09c0b4918a77362dcd647a122_b01-el-confinamiento.mp3?Expires=1794099716&Signature=0n3LRIO2s9zuIp5FJ8IZ4kVoW8P~UXuwgflQqV-kTWgRxntbI0M9FzbgowpCUk42VEplttubs7-OHDkzUZY9lTQY3NsDrKMS2XujI4NeVXKVnEuLxBFJlCqSZYUnYZSTMAWnWzS53YGJmEJ6~k4T7BdSvTxX6nl96XcWffcJWQPcrc2uuY6q3SrIpiNgUYAdTj8ER9dvelGfJi4G3oJBwZPKJk6UOUmjdYdzClpxkcu081qrcS6bCOtbyqae0XUy06RhisbCXi10eUazv~T~Qmt2hINFc3JsaYOIZ60CJKKnNfIeOECte3J-Npz43fnPWhVwuzEQxOXjNKDodbF8Ow__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
